    "title": "Air defenses down 14 Ukrainian drones over Russia's central Tula Region",
    "text": "TULA, May 7. /TASS/. Air defenses have shot down 14 Ukrainian drones over Russia’s central Tula Region, Governor Dmitry Milyayev said.\n\"The Russian Defense Ministry’s air defense units have destroyed 14 Ukrainian drones. There were no casualties,\" he wrote on Russia’s national messenger Max.\nAccording to preliminary reports, the attacks caused no damage.",
